  "cooked": "<p>To add: here are the transaction inv-sizes to a local spy-node-like peer (does not INV any transactions to the node).</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/2f1a6bada16bd497a40195825a33cdf3f5387a5c.png\" data-download-href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/2f1a6bada16bd497a40195825a33cdf3f5387a5c\" title=\"grafik\"><img src=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/2f1a6bada16bd497a40195825a33cdf3f5387a5c_2_690x334.png\" alt=\"grafik\" data-base62-sha1=\"6IH2ULeuN8qxeextNirNr4OM3Ja\" width=\"690\" height=\"334\" srcset=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/2f1a6bada16bd497a40195825a33cdf3f5387a5c_2_690x334.png, https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/2f1a6bada16bd497a40195825a33cdf3f5387a5c_2_1035x501.png 1.5x, https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/2f1a6bada16bd497a40195825a33cdf3f5387a5c_2_1380x668.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"2B292D\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">grafik</span><span class=\"informations\">2062\u00d71000 475 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>And here is the rate at which my local spy-node-like peer received WTx invs.</p>\n<p>Normally, one would expect the rate at which we send INVs to remain fairly constant since we\u2019re on a fixed timer. However, it seems like for some nodes it actually slowed INV-sending down by about 50% while for others it (at least briefly) speed up. My theory for slowing down is: the node is overloaded to a point where it can\u2019t send out INVs at a normal rate.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/6d53d828b746bd7535ec1b1b6ab2a86188fd735a.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/6d53d828b746bd7535ec1b1b6ab2a86188fd735a\" title=\"grafik\"><img src=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/6d53d828b746bd7535ec1b1b6ab2a86188fd735a_2_690x444.jpeg\" alt=\"grafik\" data-base62-sha1=\"fB9G9YPVdPuizoe1sKYeaeergym\" width=\"690\" height=\"444\" srcset=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/6d53d828b746bd7535ec1b1b6ab2a86188fd735a_2_690x444.jpeg, https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/6d53d828b746bd7535ec1b1b6ab2a86188fd735a_2_1035x666.jpeg 1.5x, https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/6d53d828b746bd7535ec1b1b6ab2a86188fd735a_2_1380x888.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"252528\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">grafik</span><span class=\"informations\">1794\u00d71156 161 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
